{"id":"7eeed4a02b7c5a5f","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-provable.md","title":"有限推导闭包与可证关系","display":"df-provable — 有限推导闭包与可证关系","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-provable","aliases":["16-df-provable","Provable"],"display":"df-provable — 有限推导闭包与可证关系","depends_on":["[[16-df-formula]]"],"source":"§4.1 p. 224 (PDF 244); finite derivation closure expanded locally","revision_date":"2026-10-15"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-provable</span><span>Provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provable — 有限推导闭包与可证关系"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"24a3d0c12f4602b7\" href=\"?note=24a3d0c12f4602b7\" title=\"16-df-formula\">16-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§4.1 p. 224 (PDF 244); finite derivation closure expanded locally"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"24a3d0c12f4602b7\" href=\"?note=24a3d0c12f4602b7\" title=\"16-df-formula\">16-df-formula</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_\\Sigma\">\\(J_\\Sigma\\)</span> 下文编码一阶序贯；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 是有限公式列表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{set}(\\theta)\">\\(\\operatorname{set}(\\theta)\\)</span> 为其元素集。</li>\n<li>演绎系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\langle A,R\\rangle\">\\(T=\\langle A,R\\rangle\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq J_\\Sigma\">\\(A\\subseteq J_\\Sigma\\)</span> 为公理序贯集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(J_\\Sigma)\\times J_\\Sigma\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(J_\\Sigma)\\times J_\\Sigma\\)</span> 为明确给定的有限前提规则实例集。此处不预先假定任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 具有特定逻辑的可靠性或完备性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nJ_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\theta,\\varphi\\rangle\\mid\n\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_\\Sigma\\land\n\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)^*\\land\n\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\nD_T^0&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\\\\nD_T^{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq D_T^n\\cup\\{j\\in J_\\Sigma\\mid\n(\\exists P\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(D_T^n))\\ \\langle P,j\\rangle\\in R\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Der}_{16}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}D_T^n,\\\\\n\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\vdash_T\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\langle\\Gamma,\\theta,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{16}(T),\\\\\nT\\vdash\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow()\\mid()\\vdash_T\\varphi.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nJ_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\theta,\\varphi\\rangle\\mid\n\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_\\Sigma\\land\n\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)^*\\land\n\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\nD_T^0&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\\\\nD_T^{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq D_T^n\\cup\\{j\\in J_\\Sigma\\mid\n(\\exists P\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(D_T^n))\\ \\langle P,j\\rangle\\in R\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Der}_{16}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}D_T^n,\\\\\n\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\vdash_T\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\langle\\Gamma,\\theta,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{16}(T),\\\\\nT\\vdash\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow()\\mid()\\vdash_T\\varphi.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：§4.1, p. 224 (PDF 244) 对序贯、有限推导树的说明。本页把闭包正式展开，而不在 Hypothesis 中预先引入未定义的 Der。每条规则只有有限前提，因此闭包恰为有限树可推导的序贯：对树高与阶段分别归纳。具体逻辑必须另外固定 Figure 4.1 的规则实例 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>；本页本身只是通用的有限推导机制，不替代尚未完成的 DTT 演算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"24a3d0c12f4602b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"24a3d0c12f4602b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)$ 见 [[16-df-formula]]。$J_\\Sigma$ 下文编码一阶序贯；$\\theta$ 是有限公式列表，$\\operatorname{set}(\\theta)$ 为其元素集。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"J_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{set}(\\theta)","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\langle A,R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq J_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(J_\\Sigma)\\times J_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nJ_\\Sigma&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\theta,\\varphi\\rangle\\mid\n\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_\\Sigma\\land\n\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)^*\\land\n\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\nD_T^0&\\coloneqq A,\\\\\nD_T^{n+1}&\\coloneqq D_T^n\\cup\\{j\\in J_\\Sigma\\mid\n(\\exists P\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(D_T^n))\\ \\langle P,j\\rangle\\in R\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Der}_{16}(T)&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}D_T^n,\\\\\n\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\vdash_T\\varphi&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\langle\\Gamma,\\theta,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Der}_{16}(T),\\\\\nT\\vdash\\varphi&\\Longleftrightarrow()\\mid()\\vdash_T\\varphi.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":1967,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-function]]、[[16-df-formula]]、[[16-df-provable]]、[[16-df-satisfaction]]、[[16-df-validity-fo]]、[[16-df-type-interpretation]]、[[16-df-general-quantifier]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]、[[16-df-regular-category]]、[[16-df-coherent-category]]、[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]。"}],"outgoing":["24a3d0c12f4602b7"]}